  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-2TO5-R8-025$qb$, $qb$A6-02$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You receive feedback that your reports are hard to scan quickly. The learning should change future work, not only this example. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Ask for an example, change the format, and check whether it improves$qb$, $qb$Try a clearer format in your next report$qb$, $qb$Explain why the current format contains useful detail$qb$, $qb$Wait for the same feedback from another person$qb$, $qb$Ignore it because the reports are technically correct$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
