  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-5TO10-R3-026$qb$, $qb$A6-04$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You notice that a recurring team reminder is no longer being sent because its owner left. The pattern crosses teams and has no obvious single owner. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Confirm the reminder is still needed and help restore clear ownership$qb$, $qb$Tell the team the reminder has stopped and ask who should own it$qb$, $qb$Send the reminder yourself once$qb$, $qb$Wait for a manager to notice$qb$, $qb$Ignore it because the former owner left$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
